OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry this
OL,6,Fevening with clear spells and a gentle
OL,7,Fbreeze. Cloud will thicken ahead of a
OL,8,Fband of rain bringing increasingly wet
OL,9,Fand windy weather across the southwest
OL,10,Fovernight.
OL,11,
OL,12,CMonday:FFeeling mild with
OL,13,Fstrengthening winds under a band of
OL,14,Frain to start. Patchy rain and some
OL,15,Fbrighter spells by afternoon, but
OL,16,Fwinds continue to strengthen with
OL,17,Fcoastal gales possible later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
