OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FRain,
OL,6,Fstrong winds and coastal gales
OL,7,Fovernight into Tuesday, leaving a
OL,8,Ffresher day with scattered showers.
OL,9,FBright and breezy Wednesday with only
OL,10,Fisolated showers. Fine on Thursday
OL,11,Fwith light winds.
